WEBVTT

00:16.370 --> 00:17.860
Stare...

00:17.860 --> 00:18.740
Cecilia?

00:19.600 --> 00:21.900
Doing suspicious things in broad daylight.

00:21.900 --> 00:23.860
What are you watching, hiding there?

00:23.860 --> 00:25.120
Um...

00:27.240 --> 00:28.750
Lawrence?

00:29.380 --> 00:32.170
If it's him you're watching, 
why would you hide?

00:32.170 --> 00:34.000
I suppose you could call it hiding.

00:34.000 --> 00:36.500
It's just that both yesterday 
and the day before,

00:36.500 --> 00:38.880
Lawrence went into the village 
without telling me.

00:38.880 --> 00:41.630
Then, when he returned, 
he went into his room and stayed there.

00:41.630 --> 00:44.990
It made me think that he must have 
some kind of secret or something.

00:45.720 --> 00:46.950
Miss!

00:48.950 --> 00:52.020
<i>Looks like I've stumbled
into something again.</i>

02:22.240 --> 02:26.000
Episode 7

02:22.240 --> 02:26.000
Cecilia's Worries

02:27.020 --> 02:29.500
He's going out again today, too.

02:29.500 --> 02:31.650
Where could he be going?

02:31.650 --> 02:33.750
We must find out for certain.

02:34.090 --> 02:37.260
I did say that if it bothered you, 
you should look into it,

02:37.260 --> 02:39.520
but I never imagined 
that you'd actually follow him.

02:39.520 --> 02:43.140
Don't you feel at all sorry for Cecilia?

02:43.140 --> 02:44.740
Oh, that Lawren!

02:44.740 --> 02:47.270
He's being considerate toward 
an elderly person again!

02:47.270 --> 02:49.260
He really is kind, isn't he?

02:49.260 --> 02:51.280
The lady herself seems 
to be having fun, though.

02:55.900 --> 02:59.480
He doesn't seem to be reaching his 
destination very quickly, does he?

02:59.480 --> 03:01.560
He gets stopped a lot.

03:01.560 --> 03:04.380
Lots of the villagers call out 
to him, don't they?

03:04.380 --> 03:05.910
Miss Fortune Teller?

03:06.380 --> 03:07.460
Hello!

03:07.460 --> 03:10.470
I saw three people I knew, 
so I couldn't help following.

03:10.470 --> 03:13.180
Huh? You know the lady, too?

03:13.180 --> 03:14.660
We met before, briefly.

03:14.660 --> 03:16.550
So, what are all of you doing?

03:19.380 --> 03:20.320
Shff, shff...

03:21.040 --> 03:22.070
Shff, shff...

03:22.550 --> 03:25.680
I see. So the pastor is hiding something?

03:25.680 --> 03:28.320
We must expose the truth!

03:28.320 --> 03:32.810
If there's even the shadow of another 
woman around Lawrence, he must be punished!

03:28.470 --> 03:32.810
<b>Roaaaar</b>

03:34.440 --> 03:36.360
He's gone into a shop!

03:36.360 --> 03:38.020
Why would he go into a clothing shop?

03:38.020 --> 03:41.720
And how are we supposed to 
find out what's happening inside?

03:41.720 --> 03:42.940
Why are you asking me?

03:42.940 --> 03:45.740
You're the one who suggested 
we follow him, aren't you?

03:45.740 --> 03:47.640
Excuse me, you two?

03:48.200 --> 03:50.240
The lady saint seems to have disappeared.

03:51.330 --> 03:53.060
I-Is she lost?

03:53.060 --> 03:54.030
This is bad.

03:54.030 --> 03:57.140
On top of taking her out without permission, 
we've also let her get lost?

03:57.140 --> 03:59.910
We have to find her 
before Lawrence finds out.

04:00.470 --> 04:02.590
Huh? You two...

04:02.800 --> 04:04.590
What are you doing here?

04:07.300 --> 04:10.800
<i>Before I knew it, 
all three of them were gone.</i>

04:11.010 --> 04:13.230
I wonder where I am.

04:13.230 --> 04:16.180
No, no. I've come into 
the village many times now.

04:16.180 --> 04:18.480
If I ask someone the way...

04:18.480 --> 04:20.190
Oh, Lady Saint!

04:20.190 --> 04:22.360
Why are you here alone?

04:23.700 --> 04:26.320
I'm just looking around to see 
how the village is doing.

04:26.320 --> 04:29.660
That's our Lady Saint, 
always protecting the village.

04:29.660 --> 04:31.280
Well then, if you'll excuse me.

04:33.500 --> 04:36.160
<i>I replied reflexively!</i>

04:36.720 --> 04:38.290
Lawren...

04:38.290 --> 04:39.090
Oh.

04:39.090 --> 04:40.760
You're the lady saint, aren't you?

04:42.410 --> 04:43.600
What's wrong?

04:45.190 --> 04:47.590
You're the son of the woman 
with the clothing shop!

04:47.900 --> 04:48.990
Are you lost?

04:49.720 --> 04:51.180
Why would you think...

04:51.180 --> 04:52.480
I can tell just by looking at you.

04:52.720 --> 04:56.100
Where were you trying to go? 
I'll show you the way.

04:56.100 --> 04:57.460
Well...

04:57.730 --> 05:02.360
I wasn't actually sure where 
I was trying to go to begin with.

05:03.610 --> 05:07.360
<i>No one has ever looked 
at me like that before.</i>

05:07.360 --> 05:10.600
Then, should I take you back to the church?

05:10.600 --> 05:14.520
No, I was following—I mean,

05:14.520 --> 05:17.080
I was accompanying Lawren 
and got separated from him,

05:17.080 --> 05:19.750
so I don't know where he was going.

05:19.750 --> 05:20.470
Huh?

05:20.470 --> 05:23.320
If you're looking for Pastor Lawrence, 
he should be at our place.

05:23.320 --> 05:23.990
What?

05:24.820 --> 05:26.760
A home tutor?

05:26.760 --> 05:29.680
It's just for a short while. 
I'm tutoring Eric,

05:29.680 --> 05:32.520
the son of the shop owner here.

05:32.520 --> 05:36.270
I never imagined that 
the lady saint would follow me.

05:37.020 --> 05:38.940
This is the blunder of a lifetime.

05:38.940 --> 05:42.270
D-Don't worry! I'll go look 
for her right now!

05:42.270 --> 05:44.100
Rebecca, where's Eric?

05:44.100 --> 05:46.370
He hasn't come back 
from doing his deliveries yet.

05:46.370 --> 05:47.720
Then, when he does return,

05:47.720 --> 05:50.110
please tell him that I'd like 
for him to wait a little while.

05:50.110 --> 05:51.510
I'll go and look for the lady saint!

05:51.510 --> 05:52.600
We'll go, too!

05:52.600 --> 05:56.370
Hazelita, you and Abel aren't familiar 
with the village, so please stay here.

05:56.370 --> 05:58.110
He's right.

05:58.110 --> 05:59.080
Miss Mell!

05:59.500 --> 06:01.630
I'd like your help if possible.

06:02.760 --> 06:05.540
I'll do it if you come 
and get your fortune told again!

06:05.540 --> 06:06.390
Just kidding!

06:06.390 --> 06:07.720
I promise I will!

06:07.720 --> 06:09.150
Let's split up and look for her!

06:09.150 --> 06:11.200
He's usually so unwilling 
to get his fortune told.

06:15.350 --> 06:18.590
He helps me study sometimes.

06:18.590 --> 06:20.470
Though, this time it's only 
for a short while.

06:20.470 --> 06:23.600
I-I see, so that's what it was!

06:23.600 --> 06:28.000
I have to work for my family, 
so I don't go to school.

06:28.000 --> 06:29.110
When he saw that...

06:29.240 --> 06:32.240
Pastor Lawrence decided to help me.

06:32.240 --> 06:34.190
Things like how to calculate payments,

06:34.190 --> 06:37.240
the history of this country, 
my language skills...

06:37.240 --> 06:41.610
So it's possible that 
I could ask Lawren to teach me.

06:41.610 --> 06:42.610
What?

06:42.610 --> 06:47.380
I've never gone to school either, 
so I was wondering what it's like to study.

06:47.390 --> 06:49.680
What? Even though you're a lady saint?

06:49.680 --> 06:52.510
You didn't receive some 
kind of high-class education?

06:52.510 --> 06:54.760
Does it seem like I did?

06:54.760 --> 06:56.150
No, not really.

06:57.010 --> 06:59.430
<i>What a cutting remark!</i>

06:59.430 --> 07:05.270
Well, it isn't as if every lady saint 
receives a high level of education.

07:05.270 --> 07:10.780
There are many lady saints who were born 
and raised in remote areas like I was.

07:10.780 --> 07:12.100
Is that so?

07:12.100 --> 07:13.000
Yes.

07:13.320 --> 07:17.930
I was wondering, earlier, you said 
that you were following Pastor Lawrence.

07:18.530 --> 07:20.420
You heard that, did you?

07:20.420 --> 07:22.140
Why would you follow him?

07:22.480 --> 07:23.920
Well...

07:23.920 --> 07:26.280
Lawren kept leaving without saying anything,

07:26.280 --> 07:28.920
and I couldn't help worrying about it.

07:28.920 --> 07:30.480
You don't trust him?

07:30.480 --> 07:32.920
That's not it at all! I trust him!

07:32.920 --> 07:34.420
It's just...

07:34.420 --> 07:38.430
it made me wish that he 
wouldn't hide anything from me.

07:39.360 --> 07:42.440
Pastor Lawrence is a really sincere person.

07:43.240 --> 07:47.110
If you live together, then you should know 
that better than anyone, shouldn't you?

07:48.090 --> 07:49.190
Yes!

07:49.190 --> 07:52.960
You really do know Lawren well, don't you?

07:52.960 --> 07:55.730
That's exactly right! 
He is a sincere person!

07:55.730 --> 07:57.290
When he bumps into things,

07:57.290 --> 07:59.210
he'll apologize even 
though he's alone, right?

07:59.210 --> 08:00.590
He does!

08:01.940 --> 08:03.200
We're here.

08:03.500 --> 08:06.960
Thank you. You've been such a great help.

08:06.960 --> 08:07.910
It was nothing.

08:07.910 --> 08:11.100
I just happened to spot you 
on my way back from my deliveries.

08:12.960 --> 08:14.210
Lawren?!

08:12.960 --> 08:14.210
Pastor.

08:14.210 --> 08:16.800
Lady Saint, I'm so glad.

08:16.800 --> 08:18.990
Did Eric bring you here?

08:18.990 --> 08:20.310
Thank you.

08:20.310 --> 08:21.160
It was nothing.

08:21.160 --> 08:24.600
Pastor, from the looks of things, 
you must have run all over the village.

08:24.600 --> 08:25.810
Cecilia!

08:25.810 --> 08:27.570
I'm so glad you're safe!

08:27.570 --> 08:28.940
Hazelita?

08:28.940 --> 08:30.940
I'm so sorry! Wait...

08:30.940 --> 08:33.570
Why are you dressed like that?

08:33.570 --> 08:35.260
I thought she'd be bored waiting,

08:35.260 --> 08:37.660
so I had her try on all 
sorts of different clothes.

08:37.660 --> 08:40.480
This is a lesson learned.

08:42.400 --> 08:45.210
Now, allow me to formally 
introduce everyone.

08:45.210 --> 08:47.500
This is the son of the shop owner here.

08:47.500 --> 08:48.960
I'm Eric.

08:48.960 --> 08:51.720
They've invited me 
into their home here many times.

08:51.720 --> 08:55.250
And when I mentioned being 
a home tutor to the lady saint,

08:55.250 --> 08:57.250
I was speaking of Eric here.

08:58.160 --> 08:58.970
What?

08:59.220 --> 09:00.230
What?

09:00.230 --> 09:02.220
I-I never heard anything about it!

09:02.220 --> 09:05.100
I made sure to tell you! 
Remember, the other day...

09:05.100 --> 09:07.950
I'm going to be tutoring at someone's home,

09:07.950 --> 09:09.980
so I'll be coming home later than usual.

09:09.980 --> 09:12.120
All right.

09:13.180 --> 09:15.110
I was half-asleep.

09:15.650 --> 09:17.110
Really?

09:17.110 --> 09:19.110
I-I'm so sorry!

09:19.110 --> 09:22.660
Well, it's wonderful that it ended 
up being just a misunderstanding.

09:22.660 --> 09:25.240
Come, Abel. We'll take our leave here.

09:25.240 --> 09:26.570
Yes, Miss.

09:27.280 --> 09:28.400
Pastor.

09:29.000 --> 09:32.730
It's gotten pretty late. You must be tired.

09:32.730 --> 09:35.340
We can cover today's lesson next time.

09:35.340 --> 09:36.550
Are you sure?

09:36.550 --> 09:39.640
I knew from the beginning 
that I was asking too much of you, so...

09:39.640 --> 09:43.100
Then, let's call this today's lesson.

09:43.640 --> 09:45.950
Give it a casual read before next time.

09:46.620 --> 09:47.680
I will.

09:47.680 --> 09:50.220
I'm going to hurry and put it in my room.

09:52.510 --> 09:55.030
I thought that he was like a tiny adult,

09:55.030 --> 09:57.580
but seeing him like this, 
he's very much his age.

09:57.580 --> 09:59.920
You're still there?

10:00.320 --> 10:03.540
Eric isn't used to interacting with people.

10:03.540 --> 10:06.880
He does end up taking a 
slightly cold attitude toward others,

10:06.880 --> 10:08.870
but he's very kind at heart.

10:08.870 --> 10:11.720
He did see you all the way here, 
didn't he, Lady Saint?

10:13.660 --> 10:16.830
I'm sorry for following you 
without your permission.

10:16.830 --> 10:19.580
You kept going out alone,

10:19.580 --> 10:22.590
so I thought you might be 
hiding something from me.

10:23.180 --> 10:26.600
I never imagined that 
you'd think of it that way.

10:26.600 --> 10:30.350
I would never hide anything from you 
that would hurt you, Lady Saint.

10:31.140 --> 10:34.990
When you phrase it that way, 
it sounds like you do hide things from me.

10:34.990 --> 10:36.780
That's because that's true.

10:36.780 --> 10:39.520
Everyone has things 
that they hide from others,

10:39.520 --> 10:42.680
even when the person themselves 
doesn't intend to hide anything.

10:42.680 --> 10:45.800
Lady Saint, even you hide 
things sometimes, don't you?

10:46.850 --> 10:49.240
<i>Lawren's condition...</i>

10:49.240 --> 10:51.750
Which is why, now let's see...

10:51.750 --> 10:56.140
If I were to hide something 
from you, Lady Saint, well...

10:56.140 --> 10:59.350
like with stories about me from 
when I was very young,

10:59.350 --> 11:02.280
I'd probably be hiding whatever 
it was out of embarrassment.

11:02.550 --> 11:06.180
So there's nothing 
for you to feel concerned about.

11:07.260 --> 11:09.720
What am I saying here?

11:12.660 --> 11:14.610
Eric mentioned this, too.

11:14.610 --> 11:17.480
Lawren, you are shockingly sincere.

11:17.480 --> 11:20.480
Sincere? But it's only...

11:21.020 --> 11:24.500
<i>Because I don't want you 
to hate me, Lady Saint.</i>

11:24.500 --> 11:26.000
<i>Huh?</i>

11:26.000 --> 11:29.810
<i>Why couldn't I say that out loud?</i>

11:37.700 --> 11:39.240
We're looking for her.

11:39.010 --> 11:41.010
He forgot.

11:42.380 --> 11:45.010
She really likes it, huh?

11:42.630 --> 11:45.010
She ended up buying it.

11:45.730 --> 11:48.260
You're not going to be able to 
get away with it anymore.

11:48.260 --> 11:52.480
No matter how diligently you 
do your work, pretty soon...

11:52.480 --> 11:53.760
Yeah, you're right.

11:53.760 --> 11:55.110
Jealous.

11:55.770 --> 11:58.120
Looks like you and Lawren 
are having fun again.

11:55.770 --> 12:00.780
<b>Jealous</b>

11:58.120 --> 12:00.420
This isn't fun at all.

12:01.100 --> 12:03.780
"You must attend the meeting"?

12:03.780 --> 12:08.600
We pastors get together 
at regular intervals to hold meetings.

12:08.600 --> 12:10.260
Regular intervals?

12:10.260 --> 12:11.790
Since I've been here,

12:11.790 --> 12:15.140
you've never attended 
a meeting, have you, Lawren?

12:15.880 --> 12:19.720
He says that since you're here, 
Saint Cecilia, he can't leave.

12:19.720 --> 12:20.750
Lawren?

12:20.750 --> 12:23.970
W-Well, I couldn't possibly 
leave you behind, Lady Saint!

12:24.720 --> 12:27.080
He's the very epitome of 
overprotectiveness, isn't he?

12:27.080 --> 12:31.490
I mean, I do understand that it'd be bad 
if something happened to Saint Cecilia.

12:31.490 --> 12:32.480
Lawren,

12:32.480 --> 12:35.720
from now on, you should attend the meetings.

12:35.720 --> 12:38.730
What will you do during 
that time, Lady Saint?

12:38.730 --> 12:40.090
I would like to accompany you!

12:40.090 --> 12:41.000
She's honest.

12:41.000 --> 12:42.240
She's very honest.

12:42.240 --> 12:43.660
Very well.

12:43.660 --> 12:48.980
If Cecilia goes to the meetings, then I'll 
stay here and look after the house alone.

12:48.980 --> 12:51.130
Here. There's one for you, too, Miss.

12:52.860 --> 12:55.280
My older brother again?

12:55.720 --> 12:58.600
I just sent a letter saying 
that there's no need to worry

12:58.600 --> 13:01.710
and that further letters are unnecessary.

13:01.710 --> 13:05.080
It's because you write things like 
that that people worry about you more.

13:05.080 --> 13:09.240
And the meeting will be held 
at the church where I'm stationed.

13:09.240 --> 13:10.350
Which means...

13:10.350 --> 13:12.840
It's in the same town 
as your parents' house, Miss.

13:12.840 --> 13:16.140
Isn't it about time 
to go drop in at home?

13:16.140 --> 13:17.800
I don't want to.

13:18.400 --> 13:21.060
Hazelita, you'll go, too, won't you?

13:41.210 --> 13:44.710
S-So this is what they call a city!

13:45.070 --> 13:47.760
Don't get overexcited 
and take a tumble, all right?

13:48.950 --> 13:51.730
If the luggage is that heavy, 
should I help, Eric?

13:51.730 --> 13:55.220
No, I've brought an amount that I can carry.

13:55.220 --> 13:59.240
Eric, I'm amazed that you decided 
to join us on this little journey.

13:59.240 --> 14:01.710
My mother asked me to conduct 
business as her representative.

14:01.710 --> 14:04.940
You're so responsible, Eric. 
Having you here is a great help.

14:04.940 --> 14:06.720
Say, Lawrence?

14:06.720 --> 14:10.950
You're planning to hide the fact 
that Cecilia is a lady saint, aren't you?

14:11.510 --> 14:14.830
Of course. After all, there's 
no telling what might happen.

14:14.840 --> 14:16.360
In that case...

14:16.360 --> 14:20.590
you won't be able to call her "Lady Saint" 
the way you usually do, will you?

14:21.040 --> 14:22.330
Th-That's...

14:22.330 --> 14:24.600
Oh, my! Look at 
how late it's already gotten!

14:24.600 --> 14:28.170
If you don't hurry, you won't make it 
to the meeting on time, you two!

14:31.440 --> 14:33.310
Abel! Lawren!

14:33.930 --> 14:35.440
Have a nice time!

14:35.950 --> 14:37.600
We will.

14:39.050 --> 14:42.150
<i>To make him realize that only 
after we'd arrived in the city is just...</i>

14:43.940 --> 14:47.740
Now, we'll wait for people 
to come collect our luggage,

14:47.740 --> 14:50.390
and then let's go to where Eric 
has to conduct his business.

14:50.390 --> 14:53.080
It's better to get it done 
with quickly, isn't it?

14:53.080 --> 14:56.400
Leave the city layout to me.

14:56.400 --> 14:58.730
I can guide you anywhere.

15:01.210 --> 15:06.670
Pastor Abel told me not to 
trust Miss Hazelita's directions.

15:11.390 --> 15:14.680
How many years has it been? 
This place brings back memories.

15:16.920 --> 15:19.070
Oh, I'm sorry!

15:19.600 --> 15:21.850
Huh? Lawrence?

15:21.850 --> 15:22.960
Hein!

15:22.960 --> 15:26.450
Goodness! Lawrence, it's been a while!

15:26.450 --> 15:28.240
Camilla! Eurie!

15:28.240 --> 15:30.860
So, you've finally come 
to a meeting, huh, Lawrence?

15:30.860 --> 15:32.950
I'm sorry I haven't been able to make it.

15:32.950 --> 15:34.320
You should be.

15:34.320 --> 15:37.200
And Abel went over there 
without saying anything to anyone, too.

15:37.200 --> 15:40.450
It would've been too much work 
to take messages for Lawrence.

15:40.450 --> 15:41.330
Hey!

15:41.330 --> 15:43.040
You all look well!

15:43.040 --> 15:45.710
And you haven't changed at all, Lawrence.

15:46.160 --> 15:48.330
Perhaps your hair is a little longer?

15:48.330 --> 15:49.530
Aren't you going to cut it?

15:49.530 --> 15:51.380
We have a heap of things to talk about,

15:52.090 --> 15:54.960
but the senior pastors say 
they have a scolding for Abel.

15:54.960 --> 15:55.940
For real?

15:55.940 --> 15:58.160
You did run off and abandon your duties.

15:58.160 --> 16:00.840
Lawrence, why don't you 
and I head to the meeting room?

16:00.840 --> 16:02.640
All right. Thanks.

16:06.220 --> 16:07.720
<i>Lawren...</i>

16:07.720 --> 16:12.480
<i>I wonder if he has any friends 
other than Abel coming to the meeting.</i>

16:13.830 --> 16:15.160
It's over.

16:15.160 --> 16:18.750
Good work. All those 
stares must've really hurt.

16:18.750 --> 16:20.820
Though, if I know you, 
you'll recover quickly.

16:21.250 --> 16:22.630
Thanks.

16:22.630 --> 16:24.630
Young Lawrence?

16:24.630 --> 16:26.370
I need to speak with you.

16:26.370 --> 16:27.750
This way.

16:34.850 --> 16:37.430
<i>Back when I was a student, he was 
my teacher. He really helped me out.</i>

16:37.430 --> 16:40.280
<i>Pastor Hugo was also one
of my grandpa's friends.</i>

16:41.120 --> 16:44.280
I've heard a certain rumor.

16:44.280 --> 16:46.280
That at your church...

16:46.280 --> 16:49.270
you have a lady saint.

16:52.740 --> 16:55.770
She hasn't become 
the focus of worship, has she?

16:55.770 --> 16:59.950
The villagers all treat her 
with affection, that's all.

16:59.950 --> 17:03.330
She isn't being treated horribly by anyone?

17:03.330 --> 17:05.330
No one would do that!

17:06.210 --> 17:08.090
I'm sure they wouldn't.

17:08.090 --> 17:10.810
After all, the one who raised you

17:10.810 --> 17:14.350
taught you how a lady 
saint should be treated.

17:14.650 --> 17:15.840
Yes.

17:16.430 --> 17:18.690
Even now, I know my responsibilities.

17:19.390 --> 17:24.390
It seems that Oswell wasn't wrong 
to educate you as he did.

17:24.390 --> 17:27.900
However, it's best that 
you keep quiet about having

17:27.900 --> 17:30.900
a lady saint at your church 
while you're here.

17:30.900 --> 17:35.410
This is a place which brought 
great tragedy to a lady saint.

17:35.410 --> 17:38.850
She was treated as an entity 
which transcended humanity.

17:38.850 --> 17:42.410
She wasn't even allowed to be ill.

17:42.410 --> 17:47.080
How would someone who knew her feel 
about another lady saint?

17:47.080 --> 17:50.290
It's difficult even to imagine it.

17:50.290 --> 17:53.520
There's no harm in acting cautiously.

17:53.880 --> 17:54.920
Yes, sir.

17:54.920 --> 18:00.080
Still, to think you'd be living 
with a lady, Lawrence.

18:00.080 --> 18:02.800
I'm sure Oswell would be overjoyed.

18:08.360 --> 18:10.060
Did you finish your talk?

18:10.060 --> 18:10.840
Yeah.

18:10.840 --> 18:14.820
I thought I was going to get scolded 
for not coming to meetings.

18:14.820 --> 18:16.820
But he was concerned for you, right?

18:18.140 --> 18:22.030
I'm glad I came to the meeting 
since I got to see him.

18:23.080 --> 18:25.080
Lawren!

18:25.080 --> 18:26.130
Ce—

18:29.470 --> 18:31.320
Why are you here?

18:31.320 --> 18:34.420
You could have gone ahead 
to Miss Hazelita's home.

18:34.420 --> 18:37.160
I finished my business, 
and we ended up passing by here.

18:37.160 --> 18:38.550
Thanks, Eric.

18:38.550 --> 18:42.580
The city is big, isn't it? 
Did anything catch your attention?

18:42.580 --> 18:44.490
Yes, lots of things!

18:44.490 --> 18:46.410
You seem very friendly with each other.

18:46.980 --> 18:48.600
Are you acquaintances of Lawrence?

18:48.600 --> 18:49.480
Everyone!

18:49.800 --> 18:54.360
These are my friends from school, 
Hein, Camilla, and Eurie.

18:54.360 --> 18:56.600
<i>Lawren's friends!</i>

18:56.600 --> 18:59.070
Everyone, this is Ce...

18:59.900 --> 19:01.390
Ce...

19:04.400 --> 19:07.650
I'm Cecilia. Nice to meet you.

19:07.650 --> 19:09.650
Stare.

19:09.650 --> 19:13.590
It's quite unusual for Lawrence 
to bring a girl along.

19:13.590 --> 19:14.920
What are you to each other?

19:14.920 --> 19:16.540
Well...

19:16.540 --> 19:18.800
You wouldn't be his bride 
or something, would you?

19:18.800 --> 19:19.760
B-Bri...

19:19.760 --> 19:21.940
N-No, nothing like that!

19:25.100 --> 19:28.880
Is there somewhere with a mirror near here?

19:28.880 --> 19:33.100
Oh, allow me to show you to the powder room.

19:33.100 --> 19:33.980
I'll go, too!

19:33.980 --> 19:35.400
No, I don't think you should.

19:41.860 --> 19:45.150
Now, this should be a good enough place.

19:47.180 --> 19:48.620
You there.

19:48.620 --> 19:51.660
What is the true relationship 
between you and Lawrence?

19:52.960 --> 19:56.960
<i>Could this what people refer 
to as a relationship bloodbath?</i>

19:56.960 --> 20:01.680
<i>But my feelings aren't 
inferior to anyone else's.</i>

20:02.040 --> 20:03.560
Um, I—

20:03.560 --> 20:06.040
I knew it! Are you sweethearts?

20:06.040 --> 20:06.970
What?

20:06.970 --> 20:12.210
You see, Lawrence is good at his work, 
he's sociable, and he's got good looks,

20:12.210 --> 20:14.670
but because he's unbelievably 
ignorant of romance,

20:14.670 --> 20:18.230
we've never heard a single 
light-hearted story about him.

20:18.230 --> 20:22.340
So, seeing him now 
with such an adorable girl...

20:22.340 --> 20:23.800
It's just wonderful!

20:23.800 --> 20:25.770
Our Lawrence!

20:26.060 --> 20:31.080
I'm so sorry. She looks after 
Lawrence as though she's his mother.

20:31.080 --> 20:35.250
<i>Lawrence has a lot 
of unusual people as his friends.</i>

20:35.250 --> 20:38.820
So, how is everything going? 
What is it like when you two are together?

20:38.820 --> 20:40.720
What? Um...

20:40.720 --> 20:42.330
If you're too persistent,

20:42.330 --> 20:44.470
I can't imagine you'll leave 
a good impression on her.

20:45.000 --> 20:47.340
Oh, I didn't realize you were here.

20:47.340 --> 20:52.560
She is a guest of my family, 
so I must insist she be treated hospitably.

20:54.070 --> 20:55.600
So this is where you are!

20:56.070 --> 20:58.560
Both of you, return to your work!

20:58.560 --> 20:59.450
Uh oh!

20:59.450 --> 21:01.600
We have to hurry up and take her back!

21:01.600 --> 21:04.090
That's true. She'll get lost otherwise.

21:04.090 --> 21:07.910
Oh, I'll take her. You two should head back.

21:07.910 --> 21:08.580
What?

21:08.580 --> 21:10.090
May we leave it to you then?

21:10.090 --> 21:12.240
We'll apologize to Lawrence later!

21:12.240 --> 21:14.420
We're so sorry, Miss Cecilia!

21:15.840 --> 21:18.670
Um, may I ask who you are?

21:19.670 --> 21:22.890
Even in a crowd, I knew you at once.

21:23.460 --> 21:26.720
You shine so differently 
from regular people.

21:27.360 --> 21:29.220
You're...

21:29.220 --> 21:30.230
Miss Cecilia!

21:32.470 --> 21:34.350
Lawren?!

21:34.350 --> 21:36.850
She is traveling with me.

21:36.850 --> 21:38.600
May I ask who you are?

21:38.600 --> 21:39.950
My apologies.

21:39.950 --> 21:42.230
Was it wrong of me
to touch her so casually?

21:45.290 --> 21:47.740
You are even more 
overprotective than I've heard.

21:48.350 --> 21:51.000
I am Giselbert Aldridge.

21:51.000 --> 21:55.720
It seems my little sister, Hazelita, 
has imposed on you quite a bit.

23:28.470 --> 23:31.330
Hazelita, what kind of shop is this?

23:31.330 --> 23:33.720
That's junk food.

23:33.720 --> 23:35.340
Junk...

23:35.340 --> 23:36.600
I'm so curious!

23:36.600 --> 23:39.700
Let's get Lawrence's permission first.
